WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.670
OpenAI booked a booth at a big robot conference.

00:02.770 --> 00:04.370
Then it broke up its robot team.

00:04.760 --> 00:05.630
Booth two-oh-eight.

00:05.760 --> 00:06.500
No logo.

00:06.590 --> 00:07.350
No demo.

00:07.750 --> 00:09.620
OpenAI says this is not a retreat.

00:09.770 --> 00:12.740
The robot team now sits inside the team that builds GPT.

00:12.890 --> 00:15.690
Because OpenAI says its chatbot can run robots now.

00:15.990 --> 00:20.230
In one Nvidia test, in simulation, it scored nearly seventy-five percent.

00:20.350 --> 00:22.680
The best robot-only models? Fifty-one.

00:23.195 --> 00:25.610
So the chatbot is now the robot department.

00:26.160 --> 00:28.190
What should OpenAI have put in booth two-oh-eight?

00:28.365 --> 00:29.630
Wrong answers only.
